text InquillTown_Text_Object1 {
    "Check out our shop! We’re offering\n"
    "a promotional Wailmer Pail to new\l"
    "customers."
}

text InquillTown_Text_Object2 {
    "The air in this town is so clean and\n"
    "fresh thanks to efforts to keep it\l"
    "green.\p"
    "That new lab on the edge of town only\n"
    "got approved when it promised to use\l"
    "clean hydroelectric energy."
}

text InquillTown_Text_Object3 {
    "Ah, I love to stroll and smell the\n"
    "flowers. Inquill may be uneventful,\l"
    "but it’s beautiful."
}

text InquillTown_Text_Object4 {
    "I smell something delicious from in\n"
    "the house. I need to finish watering\l"
    "these plants and get inside."
}

text InquillTown_Text_Object5 {
    "Are you here to challenge the gym?\n"
    "Their Pokémon are so cute!"
}

text InquillTown_Text_Object6 {
    "Sigh… Can’t you see I’m on break, kid?\p"
    "You’ll have to go in the mart if you\n"
    "want to buy items."
}
